  "title": "ShoppingListAisleGrouper",
  "agent_type": "developer",
  "description": "Add `CookbookApp/ShoppingLists/ShoppingListAisleGrouper.swift` \u2014 a view-layer helper that iterates `ShoppingList.text` once. Each `^## <name>$` line opens a new named bucket; each `ShoppingListItem` is assigned to the most recent bucket. Items before the first `## heading` go into a leading bucket with `name == nil`. Returns `[(name: String?, items: [ShoppingListItem])]`. Does not modify `text` and has no CookbookCore dependency beyond the existing `ShoppingList` and `ShoppingListItem` types.",
  "status": "in_progress",
  "bead_type": "task",
  "parent_id": "B-bbc48bfa",
  "dependencies": [],
  "acceptance_criteria": [
    "Items before any `## heading` land in the nil-named bucket",
    "Items after `## produce` land in a bucket named \"produce\"",
    "A second `## dairy` heading switches subsequent items into a new \"dairy\" bucket",
    "Multiple consecutive `## heading` lines with no items between them are tolerated (empty intermediate buckets)",
    "ShoppingList.text is never mutated",
    "Pure function: same input always produces same output"
  ],
